{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257030/extras/heartwormSteamPageStory.gif?t=1744733690\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sam, unable to move on from the death of her beloved grandfather, falls down an internet rabbit hole chasing the promise of reuniting with him.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Following the lead of a mysterious forum, she finds herself at a supposedly supernatural house in the mountain, hoping to make contact with the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257030/extras/heartwormSteamPageFeatures.gif?t=1744733690\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A journey through grief and loss within retro-inspired atmospheric environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4-6 hours of gameplay with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both pre-rendered and in-game cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A focus on exploration with classic puzzles, and limited combat using a camera as a weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A modern control scheme with 3rd person over-the-shoulder aiming and optional classic tank controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional pixelation and retro effects calling back to the first 3D console era for a more authentic experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A haunting original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a psychologically-focused narrative love letter to late 90s genre staples Silent Hill and Resident Evil.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1257030?t=1744733690","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1257030?t=1744733690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744733690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744733690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains written and visual depictions of death."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1257260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257030/extras/heartwormSteamPageStory.gif?t=1744733690\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sam, unable to move on from the death of her beloved grandfather, falls down an internet rabbit hole chasing the promise of reuniting with him.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Following the lead of a mysterious forum, she finds herself at a supposedly supernatural house in the mountain, hoping to make contact with the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257030/extras/heartwormSteamPageFeatures.gif?t=1744733690\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A journey through grief and loss within retro-inspired atmospheric environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4-6 hours of gameplay with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both pre-rendered and in-game cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A focus on exploration with classic puzzles, and limited combat using a camera as a weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A modern control scheme with 3rd person over-the-shoulder aiming and optional classic tank controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional pixelation and retro effects calling back to the first 3D console era for a more authentic experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A haunting original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a psychologically-focused narrative love letter to late 90s genre staples Silent Hill and Resident Evil.</p>","developers":["Vincent Adinolfi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1257030/header.jpg?t=1744733690","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120653,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120653/movie480.mp4?t=1743456426","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120653/movie_max.mp4?t=1743456426"},"name":"IGN Fan Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120653/2727b9b95660428b3ef339e9dedb99955f4a0bd1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743456426","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120653/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743456426","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120653/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743456426"}},{"highlight":false,"id":256930046,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256930046/movie480.mp4?t=1707234603","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256930046/movie_max.mp4?t=1707234603"},"name":"Story Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256930046/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1707234603","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256930046/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1707234603","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256930046/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1707234603"}}],"name":"Heartworm","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</stron